### Design Rationale Summary:

| Task | Rule Type | Justification |
|------|-----------|---------------|
| find cobblestone | position_near_with_facing | Find/locate task → player must navigate near target (center of cobblestone enclosure at [5,0,5]) and face it. max_distance=8 ensures actual approach, not trivial completion from spawn. |
| mine damaged_anvil | inventory_has | Mine task → mined item ends up in inventory. Damaged anvil drops itself when mined with pickaxe. |
| craft to diamond_axe | inventory_has | Craft task → crafted item ends up in inventory. Diamond axe not in starting inventory. |
| mine bamboo | inventory_has | Mine task → mined item ends up in inventory. Bamboo drops itself when broken. |

